# Private AI Document Workspace
## Master Build Prompt and Technical Documentation

**Project type:** Local-first AI document intelligence application  
**Primary users:** Professionals working with confidential documents  
**Primary objective:** Search, analyze, compare, and extract knowledge from documents without routinely sending private data to cloud AI services.  
**Differentiator:** A local Privacy Bridge for sanitizing sensitive information before external AI use and reconstructing responses on the user's machine.

